cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Satoshi On-Chain: a reproducible Patoshi classifier and coin-by-coin verdict tool"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, hash-anchored tracker for the verifiable on-chain footprint of the
  original Satoshi on the original Bitcoin chain: a three-tier epistemic model
  (definitional genesis, forensic Patoshi cluster, attested Finney spend), a faithful
  reproduction of Lerner's Patoshi analysis with a dormancy-validated refinement, and a
  coin-by-coin verdict tool. Graded [forensic], never [cryptographic].
type: software
